sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant S as Speech-to-text
  participant L as LLM
  participant T as Text-to-speech
  B->>G: mic frames every 20 ms
  G->>O: mic frames, sequence-checked
  O->>S: speech audio only
  O-->>B: user.speech_started
  Note over O: 200 ms of silence: Finalize
  S-->>O: final transcript ending in "?"
  Note over O: turn ends (median 340 ms)
  O->>O: search the docs locally
  O->>L: question + cited passages
  L-->>O: first token (median 340 ms)
  O->>T: first cited sentence
  T-->>O: first audio (median 145 ms)
  O->>G: agent frames, generation 1
  G->>B: agent frames + sources + text
  B-->>O: playout.started
  Note over B: first sound 841 ms after you stop
